{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"NUM","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"民数记","commonName":"民数记","title":"民数记","order":4,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"ba1ab46e42e784cde98e7b69dca91399dcc7d758951f802d5da0412989293c76","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1267},"chapter":{"number":30,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["许愿的条例"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["摩西对以色列各支派的首领说：“以下是耶和华的吩咐。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["“人若在什么事上向耶和华许愿或起誓，就不可食言，必须履行诺言。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["倘若未出嫁的少女在什么事上向耶和华许愿或起誓，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["她父亲得知她许的愿或起的誓后没有反对，她许的愿和起的誓就都有效；"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["倘若她父亲得知后加以反对，她许的愿和起的誓就无效。耶和华必不追究她，因为她父亲反对。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["“倘若有女子出嫁前许了愿或信口起了誓，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["她丈夫得知后没有反对，她许的愿和起的誓就都有效；"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["倘若她丈夫得知后加以反对，她许的愿和起的誓就无效，耶和华必不追究她。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["寡妇或被休的妇人若在什么事上许愿或起誓，就必须履行誓言。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["“倘若已婚妇女在夫家许愿或起誓，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["她丈夫得知后没有反对，她许的愿和起的誓就都有效；"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["倘若她丈夫在得知当天加以否定，她口中许的愿和起的誓就无效。她丈夫已经使之无效，耶和华必不追究她。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["丈夫有权赞同或否定妻子禁食所许的愿或起的誓。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["倘若丈夫得知妻子许愿或起誓当天一直没有反对，她就必须履行誓言，因为丈夫当天默认了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["倘若丈夫当天默认了，后来又加以反对，他就要承担妻子的罪责。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["以上是耶和华借摩西颁布的有关丈夫和妻子、父亲和未出嫁的女儿要遵守的条例。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/30.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/31.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/29.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}